# Iteration sessions live here.
#
# Each subdirectory is one session — `YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>/` — containing
# chronologically-numbered `.m0` / `.m0c` candidate files. See the
# package's README.md for the convention.
#
# This file is the placeholder so the `sessions/` directory exists in
